{"id":"7396de782f573e5f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STSynth.md","title":"STSynth","display":"STSynth","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STSynth","parameters":["B","C","k","g","t","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STSynth"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型判断与算法。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STSynth B C k g t r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(or\n  (@ STEval B C k g t r)\n  (and (not (and (@ STSig B C k) (and (@ STCtx B g) (@ STRaw B C t)))) (@ Fail r)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57b7305c7f765988\" href=\"?note=57b7305c7f765988\" title=\"ZFC_Fail\">Fail</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf7d5deceaf32084\" href=\"?note=bf7d5deceaf32084\" title=\"ZFC_STCtx\">STCtx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c5880a58f2592fe\" href=\"?note=3c5880a58f2592fe\" title=\"ZFC_STEval\">STEval</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a18be975996ccb0\" href=\"?note=5a18be975996ccb0\" title=\"ZFC_STRaw\">STRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75f0742dab21473b\" href=\"?note=75f0742dab21473b\" title=\"ZFC_STSig\">STSig</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STSynth B C k g t r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Fail","status":"resolved","id":"57b7305c7f765988","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_STCtx|STCtx]]；[[ZFC_STEval|STEval]]；[[ZFC_STRaw|STRaw]]；[[ZFC_STSig|STSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STCtx","status":"resolved","id":"bf7d5deceaf32084","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_STCtx|STCtx]]；[[ZFC_STEval|STEval]]；[[ZFC_STRaw|STRaw]]；[[ZFC_STSig|STSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STEval","status":"resolved","id":"3c5880a58f2592fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_STCtx|STCtx]]；[[ZFC_STEval|STEval]]；[[ZFC_STRaw|STRaw]]；[[ZFC_STSig|STSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STRaw","status":"resolved","id":"5a18be975996ccb0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_STCtx|STCtx]]；[[ZFC_STEval|STEval]]；[[ZFC_STRaw|STRaw]]；[[ZFC_STSig|STSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STSig","status":"resolved","id":"75f0742dab21473b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_STCtx|STCtx]]；[[ZFC_STEval|STEval]]；[[ZFC_STRaw|STRaw]]；[[ZFC_STSig|STSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-7"